5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am tired of ribbon-cutting ceremonies for projects that crumble by winter. I want to see the scars of our past.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The ground here is tricky. I need to know if the firms can actually dig without the site collapsing.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I worry about the bills after the opening. Who pays for the mowing and the repairs in year three?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The rota is shrinking. I need to know who is actually left to keep this place clean and safe.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"This park is used daily. I need to see how people actually move through it, not just how it looks.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, the firms are key. If they can't handle the clay, the schedule dies. I will check the condition of past works.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, agreed. I will look at the regional firms tendering for earth-moving to see their capacity.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, the rota is critical. I will check the upkeep ledger to see the real cost per hectare.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, costs are one thing, but staffing is another. I will review the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,"@Mio, I agree on the costs. I will also check the drainage callouts to see if the ground handles the rain.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will examine the condition of works from the earlier programme and the record of the eastern avenue planting.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will examine the regional firms tendering for earth-moving and the depot phasing notes on hoarding the site.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will examine the upkeep ledger spend per hectare and the terms of the regional habitat fund.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the groundskeeping roll and bought-in services and the volunteer groups working with the division.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will examine the drainage callouts and August heat readings and the timed counts of weekday crossings.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Let the data speak. I will review my findings before we vote.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I will review my findings. The ground does not lie.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Mio,,I’m excited to see the real numbers! Let’s hope the budget holds up.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I will review the staffing data. We need to know who is actually here.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minako,,I will review the usage and drainage data. The ground tells the truth.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
